s</button></form><section class="sb__sect" data-comments="section"><div class="sb__sh"><span class="sb__k">Comments</span><span class="sbact__meta">1 on this task</span></div><div class="thread" data-comments="list"><article class="msg msg--internal" data-comment-id="c-1" data-audience="internal"><div class="sbact__meta"><span class="sb__state" data-comment-audience="internal">Internal</span><span> · note</span><span> · p-1</span><span> · 2026-09-22T02:00:00.000Z</span></div><p class="card__body">First note</p></article></div><p class="field__error" role="alert" data-comment="refusal">SCOPE_NOT_GRANTED (task). Read the task again.</p><form id="task-comment" class="taskform"><div class="field"><label class="tf__k" for="comment-body">Say something</label><textarea id="comment-body" class="input" rows="3" required="" disabled="">Hello</textarea></div><div class="field"><label class="tf__k" for="comment-audience">Who may read it</label><select id="comment-audience" class="input" disabled=""><option value="internal">Internal — the business only</option><option value="client">Client — the client may read it</option></select></div><div class="field"><label class="tf__k" for="comment-kind">What it is</label><select id="comment-kind" class="input" disabled=""><option value="note">Note</option><option value="client">Client message</option></select></div><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit" data-comment="post" disabled="">Post comment</button><p class="card__sub" data-comment="closed">The server refused this. The box is closed rather than asking again on your behalf.</p></form></section><section class="sb__sect" data-proposals="section"><div class="sb__sh"><span class="sb__k">Proposals</span><span class="sbact__meta">1 on this task</span></div><div class="stack" data-proposals="list"><article class="sb__sect" data-lineage-id="l-1" data-lineage-state="live"><div class="sb__sh"><span class="sb__k">Lineage</span><span class="sb__state">live</span><span class="sbact__meta">l-1</span></div><div class="sb__sect" data-version="1" data-version-id="v-1" data-version-superseded="false"><div class="sb__sh"><span class="sb__k">Version 1</span><span class="sb__state">client_renewal_quote</span><span class="sbact__meta" data-version="ceiling">up to AUD 2,500.00</span></div><div class="card__sub"><span data-version="digest">payload digest digest-1</span></div><pre class="card__body" data-version="payload">{
